*Private_Key*
*privatekey*
*private-key*
private_keys/
keys/
secrets/

# 🚫 WALLETS & ADDRESSES - NEVER COMMIT!
*wallet*.json
*wallet*.dat
*wallet*.backup
*WALLET*
wallet_*
wallets/
*keystore*
keychain/
*mnemonic*
*seed*
*recovery*

# 🚫 BACKUPS - EXTERNAL ONLY!
*backup*.json
*backup*.enc
*backup*.txt
*BACKUP*
*_backup_*
backup/
backups/
paper_wallet*
*paper_wallet*
*CONFIDENTIAL*
*confidential*

